> [data set]. Version and DOI as recorded in CITATION.cff.

## Why CC BY and not something more restrictive

CC BY imposes nothing that the inputs do not already impose, and nothing that would
obstruct the uses the measure exists for. A NonCommercial term would exclude
consultancies, several statistical agencies, and some replication archives that
cannot accept NC material. A ShareAlike term would force this licence onto anyone
combining DAIOE with their own data, which is precisely the use the release is meant
to enable.

